            "blocks": [
              {
                "kind": "script",
                "lines": [
                  {
                    "who": "RODERIGO",
                    "line": "Tush, never tell me! I take it much unkindly"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "That thou, Iago, who hast had my purse"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "As if the strings were thine, shouldst know of this."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": "IAGO",
                    "line": "'Sblood, but you'll not hear me!"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "If ever I did dream of such a matter,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Abhor me."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": "RODERIGO",
                    "line": "Thou toldst me thou didst hold him in thy hate."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": "IAGO",
                    "line": "Despise me"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "If I do not. Three great ones of the city,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "In personal suit to make me his lieutenant,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Off-capped to him; and, by the faith of man,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "I know my price, I am worth no worse a place."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "script",
                "lines": [
                  {
                    "stage": "[Iago explains that Othello turned the great men down, saying he had already chosen his officer.]"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": "IAGO",
                    "line": "And what was he?"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Forsooth, a great arithmetician,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "One Michael Cassio, a Florentine,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "...That never set a squadron in the field..."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "And I, of whom his eyes had seen the proof"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "At Rhodes, at Cyprus, and on other grounds"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Christened and heathen, must be beleed and calmed"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "By debitor and creditor."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "...He, in good time, must his lieutenant be,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "And I, God bless the mark, his Moorship's ancient."
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "...Preferment goes by letter and affection,"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "And not by old gradation, where each second"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Stood heir to th' first. Now, sir, be judge yourself"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "Whether I in any just term am affined"
                  },
                  {
                    "who": null,
                    "line": "To love the Moor."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
